{
    "name": "編織",
    "category": "tfg:agriculture",
    "icon": "tfc:spindle",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(thing)編織$()是將各種線組合成$(thing)布料$()的過程。雖然編織的最後一步是在$(thing)織機$()上完成，但有些布料，例如從$(l:agriculture/animal_husbandry#wooly_animals)產毛動物$()取得的$(thing)羊毛$()，需要先用$(thing)紡錘$()紡成$(thing)毛線$()才能編織。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
            "recipe": "tfc:clay_knapping/spindle_head",
            "anchor": "spindle",
            "text": "$(thing)未燒製的紡錘頭$()是用黏土塑形而成，接著可以$(l:game_mechanics/heating)燒製$()成$(thing)紡錘頭$()。將它和$(thing)木棍$()一起合成即可完成紡錘。紡錘也可以用$(l:craftsmanship/metallurgy)金屬$()製作。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "anchor": "spinning",
            "title": "紡紗",
            "recipe": "tfc:kjs/damage/shapeless/wool_yarn",
            "text": "用紡錘合成$(thing)羊毛$()可以得到$(thing)毛線$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "title": "織機",
            "anchor": "loom",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/wood/acacia_loom",
            "text": "織機只需要用$(thing)木板$()和一根$(thing)木棍$()合成。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:loom_recipe",
            "anchor": "wool_cloth",
            "title": "布料",
            "recipe": "tfc:loom/wool_cloth",
            "text": "$(thing)羊毛布$()的配方需要 16 條$(thing)毛線$()。按下$(item)$(k:key.use)$()可將材料放入織機，接著按住$(item)$(k:key.use)$()開始操作織機。完成後，按下$(item)$(k:key.use)$()取出物品。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/loom_empty.png",
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/loom_full.png",
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/loom_working.png",
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/loom_done.png"
            ],
            "text": "織機的工作原理。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:relations",
            "title": "延伸閱讀",
